# intro: INTRO.EXE as START1.EXE runs it, with Tandy video and sound: the Westwood card, the four SSI cards (each a
# dissolve) and on into the title. The times are ticks of virtual time; `shot`s compare the screen and pages.
option program INTRO.EXE
wait 20
shot t20
wait 120
shot t140
wait 120
shot t260
wait 120
shot t380
wait 120
shot t500
wait 120
shot t620
wait 400
shot t1020
wait 400
shot t1420
wait 400
shot t1820
wait 400
shot t2220
quit
